{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Floor 8 is a multiplayer and single-player\u00a0horror game where you need to be attentive to not overlook any\u00a0anomalies on floors. Use the elevator to reach floor 1 and escape before monsters get you. When you miss an anomaly, elevator will glitch and take you back to the highest floor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>STORY:</strong>\u00a0You wake up in your apartment. A mysterious voice from a recorder tells you that you are trapped in a cursed building infested with anomalies and monsters. You need to escape by reaching floor 1.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>PLAYTIME:</strong>\u00a030 - 60 minutes</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>GAME MODES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose<strong> Exit 8 </strong>game mode -<strong>\u00a0</strong>press up when there's anomaly, press down when no anomalies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617250/extras/Y93j_T.gif?t=1743347074\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose<strong> Escape </strong>game mode<strong>\u00a0</strong>- remove anomalies by capturing them with your camera</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617250/extras/Saxqmh.gif?t=1743347074\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Disclaimer:\u00a0</strong>Game modes can only be chosen when creating online room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Includes public cross-platform rooms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Anomalies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deadly monsters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiplayer with proximity voice chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_para